WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.020
What?

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.160
Fortissimo!

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:13.820
What?!

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:16.530
Goal!

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.760
It's a goal!

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.960
Raimon Jr. High's captain, Shindou, makes a goal to take the first point!

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:24.960
He did it again...

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.090
Captain!

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:37.580
The first point! Yes!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.050
We did it!

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:40.080
Shindou-kun.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.020
What are you doing?

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:46.770
The score order said that Tengawara wins at 2-0.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.510
Are you disobeying Fifth Sector's orders?

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:50.730
Yeah.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:55.360
As Raimon's captain, I will say this clearly so that all of you know.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.650
In this match, we...

00:00:57.650 --> 00:00:58.910
Raimon will win!

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.260
Captain's being serious!

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.970
Baring his claws, is he?

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:06.690
The idiot.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.590
Win?

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.940
He can't be serious!

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:16.220
Well, he did just make a goal.

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:19.600
We're supposed to be losing...

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.460
Shindou...

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.530
Taichi!

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:26.270
M-Mom?!

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:27.250
You can do it!

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:28.980
Make sure you protect that goal!

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.510
The first match in Kanto's A block district preliminaries of Holy Road!

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:19.920
It continues between Raimon, runner-up for last year's Nationals, versus the famous Tengawara!

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:23.760
With Shindou's elegant shoot, Raimon takes the first point!

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.870
Raimon appears to be acting on their word.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.770
The morons.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:33.650
They ought to know what happens when someone opposes Fifth Sector.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.730
Then it's time we got serious too.

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:38.860
For victory.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:39.710
Yeah.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:45.070
This is unexpected.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:47.740
How interesting.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.340
The game resumes!

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.080
Let's go stop them!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.000
Okay!

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:55.710
Senpai, we have to stop them!

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:58.340
Shindou goes to mark him!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.300
I won't be holding back.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.190
Captain!

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:02.800
Shin-sama!

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:05.030
Nishinosora makes a forceful tackle!

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.880
But no whistle!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:07.870
There!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:09.510
The ball goes to Andou!

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:11.820
Move, get out of my way!

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.390
Hayami!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:17.900
Tengawara is breaking through Raimon's defense!

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:19.870
And now they pass!

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.070
I'll stop them!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.320
Nishizono falls this time!

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:28.030
Shinsuke!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.120
Kita!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.890
The ball goes to Captain Kita!

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:34.980
But Matsukaze is standing in his path!

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:35.580
Tenma!

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.450
Move.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.420
I won't!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.300
I know about you guys.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:47.840
Tengawara is famous for soccer, and they're an amazing team who's always fought intensely with Raimon in the past!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:53.350
Why would a team like that need to make these unfair plays?

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.520
This is our soccer.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:00.190
When you're ordered to win a game, you have to <i>win!</i>

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:04.430
It doesn't matter how you do it!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.780
Or what plays you use!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:11.790
Matsukaze!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:15.290
Hayabusa goes deep into Raimon's end of the field!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.500
Move back the defense line!

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:21.710
Well, uh...

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.090
Yeah.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.720
I don't want to get hurt anymore.

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:27.840
Guys...

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:29.710
What's happening?

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:32.940
The Raimon Eleven make no moves to answer Shindou's commands!

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:35.520
Have they gotten scared of Tengawara's rough plays?

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:38.200
You look pathetic, Captain.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:41.730
It's no use being God's Baton if you can't get anybody to move.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:47.390
The only ones resisting Fifth Sector are you three.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:53.200
How are you going to fight against 8 people who aren't on your side and 11 enemies?

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:56.150
In that case, I'll stop them by myself if I have to!

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:58.870
What makes you think you can stop my Avatar?

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.630
Your... Avatar?

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:03.380
Come out, my Avatar!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.830
Birdman Falco!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.850
That's...

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:19.480
An Avatar?

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:22.860
W-Whoa, it's an Avatar! An Avatar!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.520
Tengawara's Hayabusa brought out an Avatar!

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:31.430
I heard you can use an Avatar too.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.890
Impressive for someone who isn't a Seed.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:41.500
Let me show you how frightening a Seed with a <i>real</i>  Avatar can be!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.760
Falco Wing!

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:56.430
Think you can stop this with your Avatar?

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:06.440
Taichi!

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:08.240
Goal!

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.900
A tie! Tengawara catches up!

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:14.860
Hayabusa's shoot blasts through Raimon's goal!

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:18.440
Shindou!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.540
You can't even control your own Avatar?

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.880
And you expect to put up a fight against Fifth Sector?

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.230
You make me laugh.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.700
Leave it at that.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.130
Just win like we were told to.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.720
The first half ends here!

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:40.810
The second half will begin at a tie of 1-1!

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:48.730
A goalkeeper at your level won't be able to stop the shoot my Avatar makes.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:52.740
You better run from the next shoot if you don't want to get hurt.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:57.170
Make it as uncool and pitiful as possible.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.160
I...

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:05.710
What should I do?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.960
Everyone, what's wrong?

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.010
It's just a tie!

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:18.300
If we work hard and get another point, we'll-

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:19.980
"We'll win," is it?

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:23.310
Do you really believe that?

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:24.230
What?

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:29.190
Tengawara's Hayabusa is just like me.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:29.980
A Seed.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:35.220
He can freely control his Avatar.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.500
Unlike you, Captain.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:42.830
Now do you still think you can win?

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:45.830
With that kind of power...

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.540
We don't stand a chance.

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.990
You finally get it.

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:56.520
Even if wimps like you chose to cross Fifth Sector, nothing will change.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.010
Nothing can change.

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:02.030
Raimon's defeat has been decided!

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.210
That's not-

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.200
That's not for strangers to decide.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:10.350
Like I said...

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:15.570
No matter who it is, I won't let them decide the results before the match.

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:16.570
What?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:21.620
The only one who gets to decide victory and defeat is the goddess of victory.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:24.450
The goddess of victory...

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:30.420
But the goddess of victory will never smile upon those who don't actively seek to win.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:36.470
Are you guys satisfied with the soccer today that's controlled, even its scoring?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.510
Sangoku.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:39.930
Y-Yes, sir!

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:44.430
You were told to lose, but you tried to stop that shoot.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:47.990
Th-That was...

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:50.910
That was the instincts of a true soccer player.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:56.190
No matter what shoot comes at you, you try to block it.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:01.030
No matter who you're up against, you try to dribble past them.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.660
You try to make a shoot that's stronger than anyone else's.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.790
And you try to win.

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:09.130
That's a soccer player.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.370
The feelings that all of you have.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:13.420
Coach Endou...

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:17.590
Do you honestly feel that it's right?

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.430
To lose without even trying?

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:21.930
Ask yourselves these things.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:26.180
Is the soccer you see today the soccer you wanted to play?

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:30.980
What is real soccer? What is <i>your</i>  soccer?

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.470
What is this I'm hearing?

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:36.030
You've learned nothing, have you!

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:39.930
Holy Road isn't just a tournament for the soccer championship.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:43.440
It's an important election that will decide the Holy Emperor!

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.810
If we disrupt it, our-

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.960
I mean, Raimon's reputation will be jeopardized.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.010
As their coach, say this to them now.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:57.070
Fifth Sector's orders must not be disputed.

00:10:57.070 --> 00:11:00.090
You must not fail to lose this match.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:03.040
I've said everything that was meant to be said.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.080
W-What?

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.020
The rest is up to you to decide.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:09.560
As an individual soccer player.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.830
I'll be waiting on the field.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:19.070
N-Now hold on just a minute, Endou-kun!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.250
Coach...

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.950
Even if it's up to us to decide...

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:29.950
I...

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.300
I...

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.420
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:42.170
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:47.480
The first match of Holy Road's district preliminaries!

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:50.310
The second half of Raimon versus Tengawara!

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.220
What are you gonna do?

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:53.560
What about you?

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:57.280
There's the kickoff with Raimon in hold of the ball.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:58.980
Pass me the ball!

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:00.740
Here!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.400
Thank you!

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:06.120
Hey, why did you pass to him?!

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:08.740
Well, he asked.

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:11.500
Matsukaze moves in with his dribbling!

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.210
Damn, you're annoying.

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:17.210
But Nishinosora goes to mark him!

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:19.840
The ball goes...

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:22.240
Straight to Nishizono!

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:22.800
What?

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.220
A pass aimed carefully at the other person's feet.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:32.730
Bold dribbling without any second guessing to it.

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:35.400
Don't get cocky!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.480
Shinsuke!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.440
You...!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.900
They've been training themselves properly...

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.320
To win...

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:51.130
Taichi, nice save!

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:57.880
Practicing makes you better.

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:01.420
Being better makes soccer even more fun.

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:04.800
That's why my mind was on nothing but chasing after the ball.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:10.110
We did it! We won! We won!

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:13.370
All thanks to Taichi keeping our goal safe!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.660
Taichi, great job!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:16.870
Mom!

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:19.490
That jinx came true again.

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:23.190
The one where we always win whenever Taichi's mom comes to watch, right?

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:27.730
Your mom is seriously the goddess of victory!

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:28.940
Goddess?!

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:31.040
Don't talk gross!

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.850
Then why are you blushing?

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:35.610
Taichi loooves his mommy!

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:38.130
Dummy, that's not true!

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:44.170
Chasing after the ball recklessly without a care in the world...

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:48.640
How could I have forgotten how that felt?

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.520
Hayabusa!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.500
Kita makes a centering to Hayabusa!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:58.300
Raimon's in trouble!

00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:59.230
This will settle it!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:06.820
What?

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:07.730
Sangoku-san!

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:08.450
Senpai!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.530
Shindou. Shinsuke.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:13.850
Tenma.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.500
You've opened my eyes.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:19.000
I'll play my own soccer too.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:24.170
I want to see the goddess of victory smiling again after so long.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.980
Shindou!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:27.750
Don't hold back!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:30.200
Make a full-on attack with God's Baton!

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:35.530
Tenma and Shinsuke should be able to keep up with your passwork now!

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:38.270
After all, they've been practicing like crazy!

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:39.920
Senpai!

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.170
I'll protect the goal!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:42.860
Go!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:45.280
Let's win this match!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.190
Yeah!

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:48.360
They haven't given up yet?

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.520
Raimon begins their counterattack!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.990
Even Sangoku-san joined the madness. What the heck is going on?

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:59.420
How should I know?

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:00.210
Shindou...

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:03.740
But Kita goes to mark him!

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:06.460
It's a one-on-one between both team's captains!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:09.400
You can't change anything, Shindou-kun.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:12.390
Adding one more person to your party makes no difference!

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.460
Then I'll show you it can be changed!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:19.150
Shindou slips past Kita!

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:20.260
Tenma!

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:23.860
That guy!

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.070
Soyokaze Step!

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.070
Zephyr Step

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:34.870
I'll stop you!

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.920
Higashi hits Shindou's pass!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.920
This looks like it'll go over the line!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:50.880
What?!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.450
Nishizono traps the ball!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:57.020
What amazing jumping ability!

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:00.010
Nice pass, Captain!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.120
I-It was a pass?

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:07.780
The ball was made to go up high to make it a pass to Nishizono!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.680
A play that's calculated all possible moves!

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:14.160
This is God's Baton! Shindou Takuto's playmaking!

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.200
Cut the crap!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:16.970
Move!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.950
Hayabusa steals the ball!

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:22.960
He moves straight into Raimon's field!

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.790
Don't screw around.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:29.680
We need you guys to lose!

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:40.030
There it is! Hayabusa's Avatar!

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.270
Will this decide the match?

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:53.240
Falco Wing!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.570
His Avatar's hissatsu shoot soars towards Raimon's goal!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:00.740
I won't let you!

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:06.170
Matsukaze makes a full-body block!

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:07.880
That's...

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:12.510
We're going to play with our soccer in this game and win!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:16.520
You can't stop my Avatar's shoot!

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.010
Tenma!

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.390
Then I'll stop it with my Avatar!

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:28.390
W-What's this?! Shindou brings out his Avatar too!

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:31.230
It's a clash between Avatars!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:36.040
Blow him away!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:41.130
I knew I wasn't good enough...

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:44.120
No! You've weakened the shoot's power!

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:48.120
I'll stop this ball no matter what!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:55.840
Burning Catch!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:01.850
What?!

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.770
He blocks it!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:09.850
Raimon's Matsukaze, Shindou, and their goalkeeper Sangoku work together to stop the Avatar's shoot!

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:11.570
That can't be...

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.110
They blocked my Avatar's shoot?

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.740
It's because these guys gave it their all.

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.220
If I couldn't stop it after what they'd done...

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.490
I can't call myself a goalkeeper!

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:22.700
Senpai!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.700
Sangoku-san!

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:25.450
Tenma!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:26.620
Okay!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.370
Soyokaze Step!

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:35.590
Captain!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:38.850
Matsukaze's centering goes right above Shindou!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.600
Shindou!

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:43.740
I just know you can master your Avatar!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.220
Have confidence in yourself!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:46.680
Okay!

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:54.770
Someone who isn't a Seed couldn't possible master an Avatar.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.160
I need your help to win!

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:02.200
Come out! My Avatar, Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:21.160
Harmonics!

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:25.560
Cut the crap!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:27.580
What?

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:32.370
Goal!

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:36.910
The shoot made by Shindou's Avatar rips through Tengawara's goal!

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:40.570
Raimon pushes ahead of Tengawara at the last moment!

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.780
He did it!

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:43.850
You did it, Captain!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.750
Instrumentalist Maestro.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:48.320
That's Captain's Avatar.

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:51.970
I knew Shin-sama could do it!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.380
The idiot!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.130
You did great, guys!

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.740
Taichi...

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:04.960
The game is over, 2-1!

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:09.100
The ones to rise out of the fierce battle in the first district preliminary match is Raimon Jr. High!

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:12.640
We... lost...

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.940
You weren't joking, Shindou-kun.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:25.180
I brought out my Avatar!

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.330
You did it, Shindou!

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:30.260
Thanks to you blocking it, Sangoku-san.

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:34.860
I can't look disgraceful in front of the goddess of victory, after all.

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.090
Nor in front of the first-years either.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:41.340
Yes! Yes!

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:44.680
He's a strange guy.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:47.960
He blew away all the gloom that's been piling up in my heart.

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:52.100
He's like a zephyr.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:57.420
With him, we might be able to change this corrupted soccer.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:03.900
We... really won...

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:07.190
In Holy Road's district preliminaries on top of that...

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:09.470
We can't talk our way out of this one.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:13.420
We're doomed...

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.400
This is unbelievable...

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:21.560
A very interesting result.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.590
They're rebelling, huh?

00:22:53.820 --> 00:22:56.760
Everyone chose to rebel because they want to protect real soccer.

00:22:56.760 --> 00:22:59.270
Tsurugi <i>must</i>  have something he wants to protect too.

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.150
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Tsurugi's Secret

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:04.860
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:17.870
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.190 --> 00:23:27.240
Ask yourselves if that was what you wanted to do!

00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:28.030
That's all!
